# This repo ships the plugin only (Assets/RoomForge + docs), not a runnable
# Unity project — installing it means copying that one folder into your own
# project, same as any other third-party package. Everything below is
# project-level scaffolding a plugin user has no use for: it stays on disk
# locally (this working copy IS a full dev project) but was never meant to be
# part of what gets published.
/Assets/Scenes/
/Assets/Scenes.meta
/Assets/Settings/
/Assets/Settings.meta
/Assets/Space/
/Assets/Space.meta
/Packages/
/ProjectSettings/
